    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSt. Enda's is a charming three-bedroom semi-detached cottage, ideally situated in the heart of Rush. Dating back over 100 years, the property retains the character and appeal of a traditional period home, with high ceilings and a warm, inviting atmosphere.\n\nThe cottage has been extended and renovated by its current owners, creating a comfortable family home while preserving its original charm. Its generous garden and valuable side entrance offer excellent scope for further enhancement or extension, subject to the necessary planning permission, allowing a new owner to tailor the property to suit their individual needs.\n\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, with an excellent range of local shops, cafés, schools and everyday amenities all within easy walking distance. The national school is just a stone's throw away, making this a particularly appealing choice for young families.\n\nWith its single-level accommodation and convenient location within easy walking distance of shops, services and local amenities, St. Enda's may also prove especially appealing to those looking to downsize without compromising on space, comfort or accessibility.\n\nRush is a welcoming coastal town renowned for its strong community spirit and beautiful sandy beaches. Residents can enjoy an impressive variety of sporting clubs and recreational facilities, including sailing, golf, GAA, cricket and soccer, to name but a few.\nThe town is also well served by both rail and bus services, providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and beyond. The M1, M50 and Dublin Airport can all be reached within approximately 1020 minutes by car, depending on traffic.\n\nCombining period character, a spacious garden, further potential and a highly convenient town-centre setting, St. Enda's presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a distinctive home in one of North County Dublin's most popular coastal communities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
